    {
      "value": "A thick, pale, lumpy and velvety bracket up to 20 cm, often green with algae towards the back.",
      "sources": [
        "fn",
        "wp"
      ]
    },
    {
      "value": "Underneath: white to cream pores drawn out into slots.",
      "sources": [
        "fn",
        "wf",
        "wp"
      ]
    },
    {
      "value": "On dead broadleaved wood, especially beech and sycamore.",
      "sources": [
